1
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,450
It will protect you

2
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:14,690
from the backlash of malice.

3
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,060
Qi Fengyin!

4
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:58,300
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

5
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:06,300
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

6
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:11,580
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

7
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:22,820
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

8
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:29,940
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

9
00:01:31,180 --> 00:01:37,820
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

10
00:01:39,020 --> 00:01:45,860
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

11
00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:53,980
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

12
00:01:58,740 --> 00:02:00,540
[Blossom in Darkness]

13
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,540
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

14
00:02:02,540 --> 00:02:05,540
[Episode 10]

15
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,370
Hao.

16
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:20,740
What are you doing here?

17
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,410
How could they treat you like this?

18
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:24,760
Why stay at Mount Zhaowu

19
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,440
and put up with this?

20
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,250
Come with me.

21
00:02:30,270 --> 00:02:31,040
I can't.

22
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:34,910
But I need you.

23
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,330
Qi Fengyin abandoned me

24
00:02:37,330 --> 00:02:37,900
and left on his own.

25
00:02:38,270 --> 00:02:40,100
He still has my master's spirit.

26
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:41,350
I can't just leave him.

27
00:02:41,990 --> 00:02:43,300
Please take me to find him.

28
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:49,530
You should go.

29
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,130
If you really care about me,

30
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,500
take me to Qi Fengyin.

31
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,130
Please?

32
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:09,060
Enough.

33
00:03:10,830 --> 00:03:11,300
Yinhua.

34
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:17,370
What did you do to me?

35
00:03:18,110 --> 00:03:19,570
This prison has weakened

36
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,060
my cultivation,

37
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,340
leaving me defenseless against these artifacts.

38
00:03:24,550 --> 00:03:26,020
But my mind is still clear.

39
00:03:28,870 --> 00:03:29,900
It was the Divine Encounter Incense.

40
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:39,780
You don't need these tricks

41
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,460
to find out where Yamao is.

42
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:42,900
You know

43
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,370
they won't work.

44
00:03:47,390 --> 00:03:49,250
But if you keep defying Master,

45
00:03:49,830 --> 00:03:51,060
you'll damage your spiritual foundation

46
00:03:52,270 --> 00:03:53,780
and may even be expelled from the sect.

47
00:03:57,390 --> 00:03:58,620
I've made my choice.

48
00:03:59,270 --> 00:04:00,090
In that case,

49
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,130
I've made

50
00:04:02,150 --> 00:04:02,970
my choice, too.

51
00:04:06,270 --> 00:04:06,850
Yinhua.

52
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:09,020
Yinhua.

53
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,650
Don't do anything foolish.

54
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:21,890
If you won't leave,

55
00:04:23,350 --> 00:04:24,210
I'll stay

56
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,250
and face this punishment with you.

57
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:32,300
Yinhua.

58
00:04:37,470 --> 00:04:38,740
This is Peach Blossom Paradise,

59
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,740
created by the Saintess of the Tides a thousand years ago.

60
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:41,740
This river

61
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,570
is actually the entrance to the hidden realm.

62
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:52,810
I'm sorry,

63
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:54,210
Hao.

64
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,370
You can blame me

65
00:05:00,030 --> 00:05:00,980
or resent me all you want.

66
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,100
That year,

67
00:05:05,350 --> 00:05:06,130
you carried me on your back

68
00:05:07,030 --> 00:05:08,330
and fought your way through our enemies.

69
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:09,770
Ever since then,

70
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:12,420
everything I've done

71
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:15,540
has been for you.

72
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:18,890
Who would have thought

73
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,010
the Saintess of the Tides

74
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:23,180
had created

75
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,180
a hidden paradise all those years ago?

76
00:05:26,030 --> 00:05:26,570
Master.

77
00:05:27,150 --> 00:05:28,130
Since Hao

78
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,660
has revealed Yamao's whereabouts,

79
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,690
can you

80
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,250
forgive him now?

81
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,340
Qingxing.

82
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:35,930
Take him somewhere to recover.

83
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,050
Zhiwei, Yinhua.

84
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,700
Gather all the disciples.

85
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:42,050
We're heading to the paradise.

86
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,490
Yes, Master.

87
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:16,610
If we

88
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,490
take the Saintess's spirit

89
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:19,730
from the shrine with us

90
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,780
and seize Yamao's herb core in person,

91
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:24,460
we can revive the Saintess much sooner

92
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:26,580
and avoid any further complications.

93
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:32,050
Danshen,

94
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:34,050
forgive me for what I must do.

95
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:40,340
His Lordship is wounded and poisoned,

96
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,730
yet he's still pushing himself

97
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,810
to make a magical artifact for you.

98
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,660
He's pushing himself too hard.

99
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:47,810
What worries me

100
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:49,370
is the fang the vile black dragon sank into him.

101
00:06:49,950 --> 00:06:50,580
There's no telling

102
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,490
what harm it might cause later.

103
00:06:57,070 --> 00:06:57,810
This venomous fang

104
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:59,140
holds 1,000 years of my memories.

105
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,490
Once the venom seeps in,

106
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:03,410
you'll see

107
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,410
it's all a lie.

108
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:06,340
You've been wrong about everything!

109
00:07:09,430 --> 00:07:11,460
So what if it was all a lie?

110
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:14,290
All I know is,

111
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,810
when the mystical flower blooms

112
00:07:18,630 --> 00:07:19,930
and that woman returns,

113
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:24,050
I'll kill her with my own hands a thousand times.

114
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:25,780
Ten thousand times.

115
00:07:27,810 --> 00:07:28,900
A thousand times.

116
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:31,340
Ten thousand times.

117
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:48,050
Why are you watering the flower now?

118
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:48,850
I'm not going anywhere.

119
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,410
You should get some more rest.

120
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,290
In your condition...

121
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:52,250
You'll only make your injuries worse.

122
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,020
I don't want to wait.

123
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:11,980
This pendant works.

124
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:15,100
My Lord, you lost control just now.

125
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,730
Was it because of

126
00:08:16,750 --> 00:08:17,810
the black dragon's fang again?

127
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,980
This malice is too impure.

128
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,020
It's difficult to condense.

129
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,900
I need to cultivate in seclusion for a few days.

130
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:35,530
Yamao.

131
00:08:36,750 --> 00:08:37,890
Where are you going?

132
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,530
I've been thinking.

133
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,770
My master ended up like this

134
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:43,530
because he used up all his immortal power.

135
00:08:43,790 --> 00:08:44,730
Didn't the black dragon say

136
00:08:44,750 --> 00:08:45,300
there's a

137
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,460
Mystical Core of the Saintess of the Tides hidden here?

138
00:08:46,790 --> 00:08:47,490
If that core

139
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:49,100
can keep this paradise running

140
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:50,250
and even turn a mighty ancient demon

141
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:50,940
into a dragon,

142
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,460
surely it can save my master, too.

143
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,440
All I have to do

144
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,060
is find it, right?

145
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:58,820
So you're going to look for the Mystical Core,

146
00:08:58,840 --> 00:08:59,180
right?

147
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,980
The black dragon searched for thousands of years

148
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,610
and never found it.

149
00:09:02,630 --> 00:09:03,610
Where would you even start?

150
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:05,980
I have to at least try.

151
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:07,610
Then I'm coming with you.

152
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,100
No.

153
00:09:08,510 --> 00:09:09,200
Right now, Qi Fengyin

154
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,340
needs you here more than I do.

155
00:09:10,630 --> 00:09:11,420
I'll be back soon.

156
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,610
If Yamao

157
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:21,220
actually finds the Mystical Core,

158
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:22,940
won't this paradise

159
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,220
start falling apart?

160
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:27,770
I'd still like

161
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:29,180
a few more peaceful days here.

162
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:30,460
Form the array!

163
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,890
Is Qi Fengyin really in there?

164
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,730
Dark energy surrounds this place.

165
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,370
Can't you sense it?

166
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,460
Or perhaps,

167
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,410
Zhiwei, are you afraid?

168
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:46,980
Don't be ridiculous.

169
00:09:48,270 --> 00:09:49,700
We just need to hold Qi Fengyin off

170
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:50,770
for half an hour.

171
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,220
That'll give Master enough time

172
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,340
to seize Yamao's herb core.

173
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,130
That sneaky schemer.

174
00:09:59,270 --> 00:10:00,130
How dare he make his move

175
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:01,250
while His Lordship is in seclusion?

176
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:04,060
Yamao, you fool! Hurry back!

177
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:04,700
If you really

178
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,340
get caught by that old man from Mount Zhaowu,

179
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:07,890
it's all over!

180
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,010
It's me.

181
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,130
I know it's you!

182
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:25,820
You're the one who led the Mount Zhaowu disciples

183
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,770
right to us?

184
00:10:27,750 --> 00:10:28,850
And Yamao was worried

185
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,250
you'd be punished when you returned.

186
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:30,890
Turns out

187
00:10:30,910 --> 00:10:32,340
you went back for reinforcements!

188
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:33,340
Had I known

189
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,100
you'd all come to kill us,

190
00:10:35,790 --> 00:10:36,980
I would've killed you that day.

191
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:37,890
That was my mistake.

192
00:10:38,630 --> 00:10:39,580
Where is Yamao?

193
00:10:40,550 --> 00:10:41,530
Stop pretending you care!

194
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:43,650
You think I'll tell you where Yamao is?

195
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:44,890
Not a chance!

196
00:10:45,150 --> 00:10:46,300
You've got it all wrong, Miss.

197
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,980
Hao is here to save her.

198
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:48,980
I don't believe you!

199
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,420
Tell us now, before it's too late.

200
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,850
Of all the places in Peach Blossom Paradise,

201
00:11:30,270 --> 00:11:31,340
this spot has the most

202
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,100
spiritual energy.

203
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,370
If the Mystical Core the black dragon mentioned

204
00:11:34,390 --> 00:11:35,250
really exists,

205
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:37,770
this is where it's most likely hidden.

206
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,100
Uncle Du?

207
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:51,850
Uncle Du.

208
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,580
Your sect claims to rid the world of evil.

209
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:56,300
I understand why you'd kill Qi Fengyin.

210
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:58,010
But what have I done wrong?

211
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,850
Why must I suffer this fate?

212
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:00,940
I thought

213
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:03,530
having trained under High Immortal Danshen since childhood,

214
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,820
you'd know better than to ask.

215
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:07,850
I'm glad you still remember my master.

216
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,490
He should've taught you

217
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,650
that if your sacrifice

218
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,580
could revive the Saintess of the Tides

219
00:12:13,870 --> 00:12:15,010
and destroy Qi Fengyin,

220
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:17,890
you should willingly give your life.

221
00:12:19,910 --> 00:12:21,820
You never should've forced Mount Zhaowu

222
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,460
to go to all this trouble.

223
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,250
So you're saying

224
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,100
this is all my fault?

225
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:29,420
You won't escape

226
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:31,580
this time.

227
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:03,610
Master.

228
00:13:04,150 --> 00:13:05,220
Yamao is innocent.

229
00:13:05,390 --> 00:13:06,180
Please spare her.

230
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:07,420
There must be another way

231
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:07,940
to destroy that devil...

232
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:08,420
You ungrateful disciple!

233
00:13:09,790 --> 00:13:11,130
Last time, for that demon girl,

234
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,600
you defied my orders.

235
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,440
I thought you'd misunderstood our teachings

236
00:13:14,510 --> 00:13:15,490
and simply lost your way.

237
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,060
So I sent you to the Wuchang Prison to repent.

238
00:13:18,750 --> 00:13:20,130
But you show no remorse.

239
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:21,370
And now you dare defy me again!

240
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:22,730
Are you really going to force me

241
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:23,650
to kill my own disciple?

242
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:24,610
Stop!

243
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,730
Yamao is trapped by my master's sword energy.

244
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:27,890
If you kill my master,

245
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:30,370
Yamao will be hurt, too.

246
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:34,730
Hao.

247
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:47,890
Hao.

248
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:49,980
Don't make another terrible mistake.

249
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:00,490
If I can't touch him,

250
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,460
I'll destroy this magical artifact.

251
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:22,700
The Mystical Core?

252
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:48,580
Mount Zhaowu?

253
00:16:18,670 --> 00:16:19,850
No more running off, okay?

254
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:22,460
Easy now.

255
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:26,820
Good.

256
00:16:52,550 --> 00:16:53,100
Master.

257
00:16:54,390 --> 00:16:55,370
What just happened?

258
00:16:58,670 --> 00:16:59,610
That shockwave

259
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,420
came from the Mystical Core's emergence.

260
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:03,580
Who would've thought

261
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,330
the Mystical Core sustaining this paradise

262
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,090
was hidden right here?

263
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:12,010
Why did all of us

264
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,090
fall under an illusion?

265
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,530
It's a miasma of desire.

266
00:17:16,110 --> 00:17:18,140
A technique practiced by the Saintess of the Tides.

267
00:17:18,590 --> 00:17:19,620
All mortals

268
00:17:20,070 --> 00:17:21,420
have emotions and desires.

269
00:17:22,030 --> 00:17:22,900
One thought can lead to enlightenment,

270
00:17:23,310 --> 00:17:24,250
another to darkness.

271
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,660
That's why some cultivators

272
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:29,570
heighten their emotions and desires to advance faster.

273
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,770
Even we, who follow the Path of Detachment,

274
00:17:32,030 --> 00:17:32,980
fell under its spell.

275
00:17:34,590 --> 00:17:35,290
But that herb spirit,

276
00:17:35,750 --> 00:17:36,940
along with Hao and the others...

277
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:38,460
Where did they go?

278
00:17:39,310 --> 00:17:40,770
Likely because of the Mystical Core.

279
00:17:42,070 --> 00:17:42,900
The miasma is still here.

280
00:17:43,270 --> 00:17:45,140
Channel your power together and form an array.

281
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,940
Don't let it cloud your minds again.

282
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:49,140
Yes, Master!

283
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:02,220
Hao.

284
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:10,620
No.

285
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:11,620
No.

286
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:12,860
Yinhua.

287
00:18:16,830 --> 00:18:17,380
No.

288
00:18:18,830 --> 00:18:19,380
No.

289
00:18:30,270 --> 00:18:30,810
Yinhua.

290
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:33,810
Hao.

291
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,180
This place is filled with a miasma of desire.

292
00:18:35,590 --> 00:18:36,530
You fell under its spell just now.

293
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:38,180
Keep a firm grip on your Purifying Charm at all times.

294
00:18:48,550 --> 00:18:49,380
Oh no! This is bad!

295
00:18:49,550 --> 00:18:50,620
The whole place was shaking just now!

296
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,420
What happened?

297
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,570
Miss, wait! It's dangerous here!

298
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,900
- Stop following me! - Miss!

299
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:58,050
Miss!

300
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,980
You immortal jerk...

301
00:19:01,030 --> 00:19:01,460
Watch out!

302
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,460
I'm... I'm sorry, Miss.

303
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:17,050
I was just trying to save you.

304
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:18,330
I didn't mean to be disrespectful.

305
00:19:19,790 --> 00:19:20,700
He was trying to save me?

306
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:21,900
Of course.

307
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,530
My demonic core is shattered,

308
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:25,050
so he can't sense my demonic aura.

309
00:19:25,510 --> 00:19:26,090
Maybe

310
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:27,380
he hasn't realized I'm a demon.

311
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:28,940
Perfect.

312
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,380
Let's see if I can fool him.

313
00:19:34,350 --> 00:19:35,180
Sir,

314
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,730
Yamao and I may be friends,

315
00:19:38,030 --> 00:19:39,900
but I'm just an ordinary mortal woman.

316
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,700
I don't know how I got dragged

317
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:42,940
into all of this.

318
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,570
I'm scared.

319
00:19:45,110 --> 00:19:46,250
D-Don't be afraid.

320
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:47,490
Stay behind me.

321
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,180
I'll get you out of here safely.

322
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:51,940
Then I'm counting on you, sir.

323
00:19:56,350 --> 00:19:57,700
What a fool.

324
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,330
I'll kill him when his guard is down,

325
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,250
then devour his immortal core

326
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:02,420
to restore my strength.

327
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:31,660
Miss?

328
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:32,620
Miss?

329
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,700
She's under the miasma's spell.

330
00:20:44,350 --> 00:20:45,220
She doesn't know magic,

331
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,330
so she can't break free.

332
00:20:47,270 --> 00:20:47,900
What do I do?

333
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,180
Miss,

334
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:51,810
forgive me.

335
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,010
Are you okay?

336
00:22:37,270 --> 00:22:38,460
Good thing you were there.

337
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,290
It's the miasma of desire.

338
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:47,860
Once you breathe it in,

339
00:22:48,310 --> 00:22:49,250
your deepest obsessions torment you

340
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:50,010
until the pain becomes unbearable.

341
00:22:50,830 --> 00:22:51,570
But there's an upside.

342
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:52,570
The Mount Zhaowu disciples

343
00:22:52,590 --> 00:22:53,530
won't dare wander around.

344
00:22:53,790 --> 00:22:54,770
That means we're safe for now.

345
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:57,010
Then why doesn't the miasma affect you?

346
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:57,900
Because I...

347
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:12,860
What's this?

348
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:15,900
It's filled with powerful spiritual energy.

349
00:23:18,030 --> 00:23:19,860
This is what saved us just now.

350
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,380
If I'm right,

351
00:23:22,750 --> 00:23:23,530
this must be

352
00:23:23,720 --> 00:23:25,050
what the black dragon has been desperately

353
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,180
searching for all this time.

354
00:23:26,310 --> 00:23:27,490
The Saintess of the Tides' Mystical Core.

355
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:29,940
What makes you think that?

356
00:23:30,550 --> 00:23:31,660
Master Du said

357
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:32,980
I absorbed a wisp

358
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,180
of the Saintess's spiritual power,

359
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,290
and that's how I became a spirit.

360
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:36,660
This Mystical Core...

361
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:38,620
was formed from the Saintess's divine power.

362
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,250
So we're made of the same thing.

363
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,220
I can recognize it.

364
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:42,620
The fighting earlier

365
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:44,460
must have shaken the whole place

366
00:23:44,510 --> 00:23:45,380
and brought it out.

367
00:23:47,110 --> 00:23:47,860
Aren't you excited?

368
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,490
This thing is priceless!

369
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:50,530
And we just stumbled upon it!

370
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,660
So you can use it

371
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:55,460
to save your master now?

372
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:56,620
How did you know?

373
00:23:56,790 --> 00:23:58,290
Isn't that all you ever think about?

374
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:01,290
Then hurry.

375
00:24:01,830 --> 00:24:02,700
If the Mount Zhaowu disciples catch up,

376
00:24:02,720 --> 00:24:03,620
we'll be in trouble.

377
00:24:55,310 --> 00:24:56,460
What's causing all this shaking?

378
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:58,530
The miasma is gone.

379
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,420
Master!

380
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:09,140
If my senses are right,

381
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,660
the Saintess of the Tides has awakened.

382
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:13,420
The miasma has cleared!

383
00:25:13,750 --> 00:25:15,810
Hurry and find Yamao

384
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:16,530
and that devil!

385
00:25:18,070 --> 00:25:18,530
Yes, Master.

386
00:26:03,310 --> 00:26:03,980
Master!

387
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:05,810
You...

388
00:26:06,240 --> 00:26:07,530
How did you turn into a woman?

389
00:26:09,270 --> 00:26:10,810
W-Who are you?

390
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:12,180
What do you want?

391
00:26:12,310 --> 00:26:13,380
Not only have you changed form,

392
00:26:14,350 --> 00:26:15,530
you've lost your memory, too?

393
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:16,620
Wait!

394
00:26:16,830 --> 00:26:17,810
What's going on?

395
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,520
I went through so much trouble

396
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:20,820
using the Saintess's Mystical Core

397
00:26:20,820 --> 00:26:21,530
to give you a human form.

398
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:22,620
And you don't remember me?

399
00:26:22,790 --> 00:26:23,700
And now you're

400
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:24,900
a beautiful woman?

401
00:26:25,070 --> 00:26:26,460
What am I supposed to do?

402
00:26:26,550 --> 00:26:27,700
She's not your master.

403
00:26:31,270 --> 00:26:31,770
How is that possible?

404
00:26:32,790 --> 00:26:34,330
I saw the soul crystal transform.

405
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,490
It wasn't the soul crystal that transformed.

406
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:39,570
It was something inside the wooden box.

407
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:43,460
That wooden box...

408
00:26:44,310 --> 00:26:45,420
It originally held

409
00:26:46,310 --> 00:26:47,250
the magical artifact Uncle Du

410
00:26:47,270 --> 00:26:48,490
planned to use to take my herb core.

411
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:55,180
There was a flash of golden light just now.

412
00:27:00,510 --> 00:27:01,700
You swallowed it?

413
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,420
My master's soul crystal

414
00:27:10,960 --> 00:27:12,380
really is inside your consciousness.

415
00:27:13,030 --> 00:27:13,570
Why would you go around

416
00:27:13,590 --> 00:27:14,700
swallowing things that aren't yours?

417
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:15,250
Spit it out!

418
00:27:15,270 --> 00:27:16,050
Give me back my master!

419
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:17,440
Open your mouth.

420
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,180
Let me see! Let me see!

421
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:19,120
Let me see.

422
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,130
Open your mouth. Come on.

423
00:27:20,310 --> 00:27:21,220
Big Brother, help me!

424
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:22,000
Let me see. Open up.

425
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:22,810
Let me take a look.

426
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:23,900
- Spit out my master! - Help me, Big Brother!

427
00:27:23,930 --> 00:27:24,460
Don't be scared.

428
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:25,090
I'll be gentle.

429
00:27:25,110 --> 00:27:26,250
- Big Brother, help me! - Let me see!

430
00:27:26,270 --> 00:27:27,620
If the soul crystal is in her stomach,

431
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:29,530
we can just cut her open.

432
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:30,940
After all, she was

433
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:32,010
Du Zhong's magical artifact to begin with.

434
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:33,740
Who knows what

435
00:27:33,740 --> 00:27:34,620
she might do to you later?

436
00:27:35,280 --> 00:27:35,660
Wait!

437
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:40,530
Miss,

438
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:42,660
I got a little carried away earlier.

439
00:27:42,830 --> 00:27:43,620
I must've scared you.

440
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:44,980
I didn't mean any harm.

441
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,050
Do you know who you are?

442
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:55,050
All I remember is my name, Duyao.

443
00:27:56,110 --> 00:27:57,250
Where did you come from?

444
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:58,810
What happened before this?

445
00:27:59,310 --> 00:28:00,220
You don't remember any of it?

446
00:28:05,350 --> 00:28:06,220
I know you.

447
00:28:08,510 --> 00:28:11,140
You're Qi Fengyin.

448
00:28:12,830 --> 00:28:13,730
But I've never met you.

449
00:28:27,260 --> 00:28:28,220
Do you recognize me?

450
00:28:28,470 --> 00:28:29,200
I'm Yamao.

451
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:36,250
Right now, the most important thing

452
00:28:36,510 --> 00:28:37,570
is getting my master's soul crystal

453
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:38,810
out of your consciousness.

454
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:39,860
Do you know how to channel your energy?

455
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:41,700
Then just follow my lead.

456
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,290
Got it?

457
00:28:42,310 --> 00:28:43,330
We need to save my master first.

458
00:28:46,550 --> 00:28:47,330
It's almost dawn.

459
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:48,220
You...

460
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:48,940
It's okay.

461
00:28:49,400 --> 00:28:50,290
If you can't get it out,

462
00:28:50,310 --> 00:28:51,140
I can help you.

463
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:23,140
The miasma has finally cleared.

464
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:31,050
Forget it.

465
00:29:32,270 --> 00:29:33,490
That boy's immortal core

466
00:29:34,070 --> 00:29:36,010
might already be tainted by the miasma.

467
00:29:36,210 --> 00:29:36,980
He's not worth eating.

468
00:29:37,830 --> 00:29:38,700
Besides,

469
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:40,220
I need to hurry

470
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,490
and meet up with His Lordship and Yamao.

471
00:29:57,030 --> 00:29:58,050
Look at you.

472
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:59,290
You knew you couldn't

473
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:00,180
purge the miasma's poison from your body.

474
00:30:00,310 --> 00:30:01,380
Why'd you have to play the hero?

475
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:03,530
I can't even tell

476
00:30:03,590 --> 00:30:04,810
which one of us is the bigger fool.

477
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:14,250
I stole this

478
00:30:14,270 --> 00:30:15,570
from Yamao

479
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:17,250
to save my own life.

480
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:18,570
You're lucky I'm giving it to you.

481
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:27,460
What an idiot!

482
00:30:28,110 --> 00:30:29,010
Just look at you!

483
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:30,250
You can't even handle

484
00:30:30,270 --> 00:30:31,090
the effects of a mystical herb.

485
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:40,620
You're awake?

486
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:43,250
Y-You're a little demon!

487
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,290
No, I'm not!

488
00:32:14,550 --> 00:32:15,090
Uncle Du.

489
00:32:15,510 --> 00:32:16,860
Must you really be so ruthless?

490
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:24,620
She was born from Uncle Du's magical artifact.

491
00:32:25,510 --> 00:32:26,290
Why won't you even

492
00:32:26,310 --> 00:32:27,050
spare one of your own?

493
00:32:27,270 --> 00:32:27,730
Form the array!

494
00:32:30,240 --> 00:32:31,530
If we fight them now,

495
00:32:31,640 --> 00:32:33,980
are we really going to fight to the death?

496
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:38,420
My Lord, get them out of here.

497
00:32:49,160 --> 00:32:49,700
Youyou?

498
00:32:50,030 --> 00:32:50,980
You can use demonic magic now?

499
00:32:51,030 --> 00:32:51,860
Back in the woods,

500
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,220
I breathed in some strange miasma

501
00:32:53,350 --> 00:32:54,530
and regained some of my demonic power.

502
00:32:54,680 --> 00:32:55,730
Let's hurry and find His Lordship.

503
00:32:56,790 --> 00:32:57,940
Qi Fengyin and Duyao

504
00:32:58,200 --> 00:32:59,010
must have gotten

505
00:32:59,030 --> 00:32:59,860
separated from us during the retreat.

506
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:00,620
Duyao?

507
00:33:01,310 --> 00:33:02,010
That's what I wanted to ask.

508
00:33:02,070 --> 00:33:03,140
Who's that woman

509
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:03,700
who appeared out of nowhere?

510
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:04,730
My master's soul crystal

511
00:33:04,750 --> 00:33:05,940
is still inside her consciousness.

512
00:33:06,550 --> 00:33:07,700
Let's find them first.

513
00:33:07,830 --> 00:33:08,420
Wait.

514
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:09,090
While I was gone,

515
00:33:09,110 --> 00:33:09,860
what on earth happened?

516
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:11,980
I'll explain on the way.

517
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:12,460
Come on.

518
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,810
Why did you rush in like that?

519
00:33:24,350 --> 00:33:25,620
That man was trying to kill you.

520
00:33:26,070 --> 00:33:27,140
Don't do that again.

521
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:30,220
I don't need you to protect me.

522
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:39,570
That soul crystal...

523
00:33:44,550 --> 00:33:45,050
Master.

524
00:33:46,030 --> 00:33:46,770
Forgive me for arriving so late.

525
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,730
The Mystical Core sustaining this paradise

526
00:33:55,830 --> 00:33:56,490
is gone.

527
00:33:58,030 --> 00:34:00,700
Without it, this entire realm

528
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:02,050
will soon collapse.

529
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:02,900
Master,

530
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:05,420
we can't stay here any longer.

531
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:06,730
We must leave at once.

532
00:34:08,070 --> 00:34:08,780
We have to leave.

533
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:11,090
So do they.

534
00:34:11,590 --> 00:34:13,050
If we guard the lake at the exit,

535
00:34:13,590 --> 00:34:14,490
Qi Fengyin and the others

536
00:34:14,670 --> 00:34:15,740
will walk right into our trap.

537
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:16,490
Hao.

538
00:34:17,070 --> 00:34:18,210
You've been my disciple for years.

539
00:34:18,630 --> 00:34:20,300
I know what kind of person you are.

540
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,380
You would never sacrifice someone for the greater good

541
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:23,940
and hurt an innocent person.

542
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:25,050
But now,

543
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,050
Yamao doesn't have to die.

544
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:30,010
Qi Fengyin, however, must be killed.

545
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:30,940
And one more thing.

546
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:32,820
The woman in white

547
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:34,090
who's traveling with them

548
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:36,940
must be brought back to Mount Zhaowu.

549
00:34:37,400 --> 00:34:38,340
Thank you for your mercy, Master.

550
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:39,260
I

551
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:41,530
will do everything I can to kill Qi Fengyin.

552
00:34:47,480 --> 00:34:48,130
It's healed?

553
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:50,050
That's a relief.

554
00:34:50,510 --> 00:34:51,490
Good thing you're so powerful.

555
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:52,900
It wasn't my doing.

556
00:34:53,670 --> 00:34:55,090
Big Brother healed me.

557
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:57,940
Big Brother?

558
00:34:58,920 --> 00:34:59,460
How dare you!

559
00:35:00,590 --> 00:35:02,050
You barely know His Lordship!

560
00:35:02,230 --> 00:35:03,340
Who said you could call him that?

561
00:35:03,550 --> 00:35:04,050
Don't call him that again!

562
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,380
Let me check you again.

563
00:35:06,920 --> 00:35:07,900
You're completely healed.

564
00:35:09,110 --> 00:35:10,210
The soul crystal is out.

565
00:35:12,710 --> 00:35:14,090
Where is it? Give it back.

566
00:35:14,440 --> 00:35:14,980
Why should I?

567
00:35:16,710 --> 00:35:17,490
Why wouldn't you?

568
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:18,730
I've thought it over.

569
00:35:18,730 --> 00:35:19,490
It's safer

570
00:35:19,510 --> 00:35:20,260
if I keep it.

571
00:35:21,360 --> 00:35:22,650
You lie through your teeth, after all.

572
00:35:23,440 --> 00:35:24,690
And this gives me leverage over you.

573
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:30,340
Don't look at me like that.

574
00:35:31,590 --> 00:35:32,650
Make me angry,

575
00:35:33,280 --> 00:35:34,300
and I'll crush

576
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:35,460
your master's soul crystal right now.

577
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:38,570
Qi Fengyin.

578
00:35:40,150 --> 00:35:41,460
You're a terrible liar.

579
00:35:43,150 --> 00:35:43,900
Is something

580
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:46,130
wrong with the soul crystal?

581
00:35:48,030 --> 00:35:48,980
Let me see him.

582
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:58,460
Master...

583
00:36:00,190 --> 00:36:00,610
No.

584
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:02,570
My master is dying.

585
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:07,490
The Mystical Core is gone now.

586
00:36:08,510 --> 00:36:09,380
The only way to save my master

587
00:36:09,510 --> 00:36:10,530
is to ask Mount Zhaowu for help.

588
00:36:11,360 --> 00:36:12,570
But they're after my herb core...

589
00:36:12,590 --> 00:36:13,530
Forget that idea.

590
00:36:22,110 --> 00:36:23,010
This place...

591
00:36:24,320 --> 00:36:25,460
It's disappearing.

592
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:28,130
Why did she have to faint now?

593
00:36:29,030 --> 00:36:29,420
You...

594
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:33,380
There's only one way out of this paradise.

595
00:36:33,630 --> 00:36:34,690
If we leave now,

596
00:36:35,110 --> 00:36:36,160
the Mount Zhaowu disciples

597
00:36:36,160 --> 00:36:37,130
may already be waiting outside to ambush us.

598
00:36:37,190 --> 00:36:38,380
Then we'll face them.

599
00:36:39,630 --> 00:36:41,010
We have to settle this sooner or later.

600
00:36:57,400 --> 00:36:57,940
Form the array!

601
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:05,380
Yamao, what do we do?

602
00:37:17,190 --> 00:37:19,010
Even if it takes every last bit of my power,

603
00:37:19,710 --> 00:37:21,300
I'll make sure you die today, you devil.

604
00:37:22,190 --> 00:37:23,860
I had no intention of fighting you.

605
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:26,340
But you just had to come here and die.

606
00:37:28,280 --> 00:37:29,690
You think just because I'm injured,

607
00:37:30,230 --> 00:37:31,610
I can't take you all down?

608
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:40,090
Master, watch out!

609
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:14,340
To save my master,

610
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:16,650
all I have to do is kill you.

611
00:38:18,030 --> 00:38:19,300
Why should I have to die?

612
00:38:58,070 --> 00:38:59,420
The immortal sects have defeated the devil,

613
00:38:59,630 --> 00:39:01,420
and it's all thanks to Yamao.

614
00:39:01,550 --> 00:39:02,740
Masters of the sects, please

615
00:39:02,920 --> 00:39:03,650
save my master.

616
00:39:04,190 --> 00:39:05,090
In seven days,

617
00:39:05,110 --> 00:39:05,980
when my master wakes up,

618
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:07,860
no one will dare bully me again.

619
00:39:08,110 --> 00:39:08,860
And then,

620
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:10,650
I'll go with him to Luoliang Immortal City

621
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,300
to see the Wish Tree appear.

622
00:39:36,740 --> 00:39:40,780
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

623
00:39:41,020 --> 00:39:44,460
♪So many longings♪

624
00:39:45,140 --> 00:39:47,220
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

625
00:39:47,420 --> 00:39:52,420
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

626
00:39:53,340 --> 00:39:57,380
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

627
00:39:57,620 --> 00:40:01,060
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

628
00:40:01,740 --> 00:40:03,820
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

629
00:40:04,020 --> 00:40:11,420
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

630
00:40:12,820 --> 00:40:16,500
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

631
00:40:16,740 --> 00:40:20,420
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

632
00:40:21,060 --> 00:40:24,620
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

633
00:40:24,940 --> 00:40:29,100
♪Still waits to come true♪

634
00:40:29,340 --> 00:40:33,020
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

635
00:40:33,580 --> 00:40:37,220
♪I'll stay by your side♪

636
00:40:37,700 --> 00:40:41,300
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

637
00:40:41,540 --> 00:40:48,860
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

638
